    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "Spring has a way of reminding us⁠\nthat not everything arrives all at once.⁠\n⁠\nSome things need longer winters.⁠\nSome things grow where no one can see.⁠\nSome things come back quietly.⁠\n⁠\nIf life has felt slow lately,⁠\nthat doesn’t mean nothing is happening.⁠\n⁠\nIt may just mean⁠\nyou are becoming.⁠\n⁠\nxx Atticus⁠\n⁠\n🖤 Save this for the days you need the reminder.",
